abstract: "A reproducible IS 477 final project integrating Federal Funds Effective Rate data from FRED with S&P 500 market data from Yahoo Finance via yfinance. The project documents data acquisition, checksum verification, quality profiling, cleaning, temporal alignment, integration, exploratory analysis, visualization, and Snakemake workflow automation."
